*
!cabal.project
# The built artefacts the deployment images copy. Named one by one, because the
# rest of dist/ is several runtimes that no image needs in its build context.
!dist/server
!dist/pudu-musl-x86_64
!dist/playground-runner
!packages/
!packages/**
!website/
!website/**
website/.vercel/
website/bin/*
website/data/api.raw.*
website/data/api.public.*
website/data/api.clean.*
website/data/api.sources.*
